        "Examine bills",
        "Scrutinize expenditure",
        "Improve legislative efficiency"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Money Bills (Article 110) cannot be introduced in Rajya Sabha; Rajya Sabha has a strict limit of 14 days to return them.",
        "The Vice-President acts as the ex-officio Chairman of Rajya Sabha, but is not a member of either House of Parliament.",
        "Joint Sitting (Article 108) is not applicable to Money Bills or Constitutional Amendment Bills."
      ],
      "id": "y3z18sh"
    },
    {
