    },
    {
      "id": "1b51zna",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "<ul><li>Speaker of the House</li></ul>",
        "Speaker of the House"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "i1jqbba",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "IMPORTANCE OF PARLIAMENT"
    },
    {
      "id": "svelky8",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "<ul><li>Supreme law-making body</li><li>Represents people‟s will</li><li>Ensures accountability</li><li>Strengthens democracy</li></ul>",
        "Supreme law-making body",
        "Represents people‟s will",
        "Ensures accountability",
        "Strengthens democracy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4wbhtgh",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "CONCLUSION"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3f772tm",
      "content": "The Parliament of India is the cornerstone of Indian democracy. It reflects the will of the people and ensures effective governance. Its powers, functions, and responsibilities make it one of the most important institutions in the Indian political system."
    }
  ],
